// Committed. Non-secret build settings, plus an optional local override.
//
// The Meta client token is deliberately NOT in git: this repo is public.
// Put it in Local.xcconfig (gitignored, see Local.xcconfig.example).
// `#include?` is the optional form -- a missing Local.xcconfig is not an error, so a
// fresh clone still generates and builds a Debug run: the app has an empty ClientToken
// and Meta registration fails at runtime, which is the visible, correct symptom there.
// A Release build (what TestFlight gets) fails on purpose instead, at a pre-build script
// step in project.yml, so a token-less build never reaches App Store Connect.
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
